From 6a8ec4610d15022fad2a420746a5e83dfde62b43 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AEON-7 <aeon-7@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 20:11:25 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 09/12] [AEON M2] inkling2 gfx12: small-M bf16 GEMV for
 qkvr/o_proj/dynamic taps; multi-row decode MoE

Original AEON work. ops/gemv.py: FMA GEMV for M<=4 (M<=8 for qkvr), with a
tri-input variant that projects q-side/k/v of full layers in one launch.
o_proj: the call is now _gemv.linear(output, wo_ud.weight); the AEON hook
point right after the o_proj output is unchanged.
moe_decode: one program per (column block, expert) covering all of the
expert rows (decodes each weight tile once for up to 8 rows) for T>=4.
